<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kim Alji</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kim Alji is the legendary ancestor of the Kim royal clan of Silla. According to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samguk-sagi">Samguk sagi</a>, in 65 CE, under King Talhae, he was found as a baby in a golden box hanging from a tree in the Gyerim forest at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gyeongju">Gyeongju</a>, where a white rooster crowed. His descendant Michu became the first Kim king of Silla.</p></div>
